<Markdown id="wp_rend_m14" when="!(10 + sum([@wp_ra1.code, @wp_ra2.code, @wp_rb1.code, @wp_rb2.code, @wp_rb3.code, @wp_rc1.code, @wp_rc2.code, @wp_rd1.code, @wp_rd2.code, @wp_re1.code, @wp_re2.code, @wp_rf1.code, @wp_rf2.code, @wp_rg1.code, @wp_rg2.code, @wp_rg3.code, @wp_rh1.code, @wp_rh2.code]) / 60 &gt; 41) &amp;&amp; ((@wp_rb3.value === 'bridge') || (@wp_rb2.value === 'press_science')) &amp;&amp; !(@wp_rc1.value === 'answer')">**Bri's sheet.** The lake on the left, a pipe on the right, and an arrow between them.</Markdown>

